1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:01,771
Zara: The elevator just opened by itself.

2
00:00:02,091 --> 00:00:07,134
ALDER TOWER INTERCOM: Attention, residents. This is The
Last Floor. Part one of two: the lobby.

3
00:00:07,454 --> 00:00:11,090
Bell: Nobody touch it. We go up. Zombies
hate stairs.

4
00:00:11,410 --> 00:00:14,804
Omar: I live on floor twelve. With my
frying pan.

5
00:00:14,924 --> 00:00:16,116
Zara: Your pan is not a plan.

6
00:00:16,436 --> 00:00:17,408
Bell: They're at the front door.

7
00:00:18,036 --> 00:00:19,165
Pip: Open the door! Open the door!

8
00:00:19,285 --> 00:00:20,072
Zara: Who brought the parrot?!

9
00:00:20,392 --> 00:00:24,686
Bell: Mrs. Lin's parrot. Mrs. Lin is...
upstairs.

10
00:00:25,006 --> 00:00:27,930
Bell: Fire doors. We lock every one behind
us.

11
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:30,644
Omar: Floor three. Hello? Neighbours?

12
00:00:30,964 --> 00:00:32,418
Zara: Why is every door open?

13
00:00:32,738 --> 00:00:33,978
Bell: Because nobody locked them.

14
00:00:34,098 --> 00:00:34,534
Omar: Oh.

15
00:00:34,854 --> 00:00:37,605
Bell: Rule one. Go up. Seal the door
behind you.

16
00:00:37,925 --> 00:00:39,075
Zara: Something is following us.

17
00:00:39,525 --> 00:00:40,080
Pip: Open the door!

18
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:41,336
Bell: Pip. No.

19
00:00:41,656 --> 00:00:46,540
ALDER TOWER INTERCOM: Alder Tower. The elevator is
now on floor... zero. Something is inside it.

20
00:00:46,860 --> 00:00:52,155
ALDER TOWER INTERCOM: Part one of two, The
Last Floor. Next: the roof. Follow for part two.

